'''Ultimate Humungousaur''' is the [[Ultimatrix]]'s artificially [[Ultimate Forms|evolved]] DNA sample of a [[Vaxasaurian (Classic)|Vaxasaurian]].

==Appearance==
===Albedo as Negative Ultimate Humungousaur===
[[Albedo|Negative]] Ultimate Humungousaur is a humanoid dinosaur-like creature, with dark blue armor similar to that of an Ankylosaurus. He is more burly and muscular than his pre-evolved form.

He has camo green skin and his helmet{{Refn|https://archive.is/jHA3x|group = DJW}} has three silver spikes running down the top, and two downward pointing black horns on the sides. His back armor has long spikes running down each side, his plated chest and torso are dark blue with five spikes on each end and his tail has a blue mace on the end of it, with silver spikes.

Ultimate Humungousaur's knuckles have silver barrels on them, which he can transform into four-barreled missile launchers and he also has black claws.

Ultimate Humungousaur wears the evolved [[Ultimatrix (Original)|Ultimatrix]] symbol on his chest.

In '''[[Ben 10: Omniverse (TV Series)|Omniverse]]''', Negative Ultimate Humungousaur has greyish-tan skin, his spikes are yellowish-brown, and his shoulders sport armor plating. His overall appearance is more techno-organic, almost like a cyborg. He has exposed metallic tubes on his skin and black "veins" on his skin. His missile launchers also now have a fleshy look. He wears the [[Ultimatrix (Stabilizer)|Ultimatrix]] symbol on his chest, which is slightly tilted to the left.

===Ben as Ultimate Humungousaur===
In '''[[Ben 10: Ultimate Alien (TV Series)|Ultimate Alien]]''', [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]]'s Ultimate Humungousaur looks exactly like Negative Ultimate Humungousaur in '''Alien Force''', except his eyes and Ultimatrix symbol are green.

