Ultimate Humungousaur can transform his hands into bio-gatling guns that shoot missiles{{Refn|In '''[[Ben 10: Alien Force (TV Series)|Alien Force]]''' and '''[[Ben 10: Ultimate Alien (TV Series)|Ultimate Alien]]''', Ultimate Humungousaur's missiles were depicted as kinetically unstable bone fragments.{{Refn|''link unavailable''|group = DM}}{{Refn|''[[Ben 10 Ultimate Alien: Escape From Aggregor]]''; [[:File:UA EFA DVD Ultimate Humungousaur Data.png|file]]|group = DVD|name = UA DVD}} In '''[[Ben 10: Omniverse (TV Series)|Omniverse]]''', the missiles have been changed to better resemble traditional missiles.|group = note}} which deal major damage, and can even damage and knock out a [[Petrosapien (Classic)|Petrosapien]].<ref name="AFoB">''[[A Fistful of Brains]]''</ref> As a variant, Ultimate Humungousaur can also shoot out bullet-sized pellets.{{Refn|[https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ben10/images/5/5b/Solitary_Alignment_DRAFT-2.pdf ''Solitary Alignment'' Script Second Draft]|group = script}}<ref name="SA">''[[Solitary Alignment]]''</ref>

Ultimate Humungousaur is ten times stronger than [[Humungousaur (Classic)|Humungousaur]]{{Refn|group = DVD|name = UA DVD}}, even being able to fight off [[Vilgax (Classic)|Vilgax]]'s army of [[Bioid]]s transformed as Humungousaur.<ref name="TFBP2">''[[The Final Battle: Part 2]]''</ref> He is also strong enough to lift and throw a [[To'kustar (Classic)|To'kustar]],<ref>''[[The Ultimate Sacrifice]]''</ref> and rupture the ground by just punching it.<ref name="TFBP2" />

Ultimate Humungousaur has impeccable durability, thanks to his hard-armored body and muscular bulk. This is best seen in his fight against [[Atomix]], where he was able to withstand his Nuclear Punch and an atomic blast.<ref name="FaFBM">''[[For a Few Brains More]]''</ref>

Ultimate Humungousaur has both great speed, agility and great reflexes, as he was able to easily dodge attacks from [[Antonio]].<ref name="Girl Trouble">''[[Girl Trouble]]''</ref>

Ultimate Humungousaur is resistant to both fire and heat, as demonstrated when he ran through flames ignited by a [[Mark 12 Techadorian Multiblaster]].<ref name="TFBP2" /> 

Ultimate Humungousaur's tail is powerful enough to knock away his opponents, such as [[Captain Nemesis]], with ease.<ref name="HT">''[[Hero Time]]''</ref> He also has a mace on his tail for some extra damage.

==Weaknesses==
<gallery type="slideshow">
ATTWN (144).png|Constrained by Large Size
UPdC (609).png|Electricity Vulnerability
</gallery>
Ultimate Humungousaur's size can make moving through areas designed for smaller species difficult.<ref name="ATTWN">''[[And Then There Were None]]''</ref>

Like Humungousaur, Ultimate Humungousaur is vulnerable to electricity, such as that generated by a [[Conductoid]].<ref name="AFoB"/>

==History==
===Alien Force===
*Ultimate Humungousaur first appeared in ''[[The Final Battle: Part 1]]'', where he was used by [[Albedo]] to defeat [[Humungousaur (Classic)|Humungousaur]].
*In ''[[The Final Battle: Part 2]]'', Negative Ultimate Humungousaur was defeated by an army of [[Bioid]]s as Humungousaurs under the orders of [[Vilgax (Classic)|Vilgax]].

===Ultimate Alien===
*Ultimate Humungousaur was first used by [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] in ''[[Too Hot to Handle]]'', where he briefly battled [[P'Andor]], [[Buzz (Too Hot to Handle)|Buzz]], [[Surgeon]], and [[Hammer]] and accidentally caused a cave in.
*In ''[[Hero Time]]'', Ultimate Humungousaur fought [[Captain Nemesis|Overlord]] before switching into [[Goop (Classic)|Goop]].
*In ''[[Where the Magic Happens]]'', Ultimate Humungousaur briefly battled [[Addwaitya]] and some [[Scrutin]]s before escaping [[Legerdomain]].
*In ''[[The Enemy of My Enemy]]'', Ultimate Humungousaur battled and was defeated by [[Ultimate Kevin]].
*In ''[[Girl Trouble]]'', Ultimate Humungousaur defeated [[Antonio]].
*In ''[[The Ultimate Sacrifice]]'', Ultimate Humungousaur battled the [[Tripledecker]] until [[Sentient Ultimate Humungousaur]] took over his body. Ultimate Humungousaur's personality alternated between his sentient counterpart's and Ben's until he reverted in a way that trapped Ben inside the [[Ultimatrix (Original)|Ultimatrix]].
*In ''[[Solitary Alignment]]'', Ultimate Humungousaur battled [[Sir George]] until they made an agreement over what will happen regarding the showdown with [[Dagon]].
*In ''[[Couples Retreat]]'', Ultimate Humungousaur fought [[Michael Morningstar (Classic)|Darkstar]].
*In ''[[Night of the Living Nightmare]]'', Ultimate Humungousaur was seen confronting [[Albedo]] in a dream.

===Omniverse===
*In ''[[The Ultimate Heist]]'', Negative Ultimate Humungousaur attacked [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] and was pinned down by [[Eye Guy]] before switching into Negative [[Ultimate Echo Echo]].
*In ''[[A Fistful of Brains]]'', Negative Ultimate Humungousaur defeated [[Crashhopper]] and [[Diamondhead (Classic)|Diamondhead]], but was defeated by [[Feedback]].
*In ''[[For a Few Brains More]]'', Negative Ultimate Humungousaur defeated [[Bloxx]], but was quickly defeated by [[Atomix]] and switched into Negative [[Ultimate Spidermonkey]] off-screen.
*In ''[[And Then There Were None]]'', Negative Ultimate Humungousaur chased after [[Ben Tennyson (No Watch Timeline)|No Watch Ben]] before [[Spidermonkey (Classic)|Spidermonkey]] got the latter to safety.

===[[Ultimate Alien Future Timeline|Ultimate Alien Future]]===
*In ''[[Ben 10,000 Returns]]'', [[Ultimate Ben]] altered used Ultimate Humungousaur's powers twice to fight [[Eon]]'s [[Eon's Minions (Ben 10,000 Returns)|minions]].

