==Trivia ==
*Negative Ultimate Humungousaur is the first [[Ultimate Forms|Ultimate form]] to appear onscreen.
**He is also the first Ultimate to be accessed via the [[Ultimatrix (Stabilizer)|recreated Ultimatrix]].
*Ultimate Humungousaur is the only Ultimate form that appeared in three different shows in the Classic Continuity, and was the only Ultimate Form to be used by [[Albedo]] outside of '''[[Ben 10: Omniverse (TV Series)|Omniverse]]'''.
*Ultimate Humungousaur was the [[Alien of the Month]] in April 2011.
*Ultimate Humungousaur lacks his [[Humungousaur (Classic)|devolved counterpart]]'s ability to change his size.{{Refn|Ultimate Humungousaur was promoted as being capable of growing up to 120 feet tall on the [[Cartoon Network]] website,{{Refn|[[:File:Ultimate Humungousaur Website.PNG]]|group = CN}} but this idea was later discarded later, as [[Dwayne McDuffie]] has stated several times that the Ultimate Humungousaur does not have the ability to grow.{{Refn|[[:File:Ultimate Humungousaur Can't Grow 1.PNG]]|name = Can’t grow 1|group = DM}}{{Refn|[[:File:Ultimate Humungousaur Can't Grow 2.PNG]]|name = Can’t grow 2|group = DM}} Dwayne McDuffie even said that the Cartoon Network website was mistaken when it said that Ultimate Humungousaur could grow.{{Refn|[[:File:Ultimate Humungousaur Can't Grow 3.png]]|name = Can’t grow 3|group = DM}}|group = note}}
*Ultimate Humungousaur's '''Omniverse''' design was created by [[Steven Choi]] alongside [[Chap Yaep]] and Dou Hong.{{Refn|[[:File:Derrick's work on the Ultimate forms.PNG]]|group = DJW}}
*Ultimate Humungousaur was originally supposed to appear in:
**''[[Escape From Aggregor]]''. His role was taken by [[Brainstorm]] in the final version of the episode.{{Refn|[https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ben10/images/6/60/EFA_Script_Outline.pdf ''Escape From Aggregor'' Script Outline]|group = outline}}
**''[[Catch a Falling Star]]'', serving the same purpose his [[Humungousaur (Classic)|regular form]] did in the final version of the episode.{{Refn|https://preservetube.com/watch?v&#61;2nlTm8GKnt8|group = am}}<ref>''[[Catch a Falling Star]]''</ref>
*In ''[[Ben 10,000 Returns]]'', Ultimate Humungousaur was supposed to attack [[Eon's Minions (Ben 10,000 Returns)|Eon's minions]] with his missiles instead of just sweeping them away.{{Refn|[https://dwaynemcduffie.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/WEBSITE-B10UA-ep307-Ben-10000-Returns-SCRIPT-D1.pdf ''Ben 10,000 Returns'' Final Revised Draft]|group = script}}
*Ultimate Humungousaur was originally not supposed to appear in the dream in ''[[Night of the Living Nightmare]]''.{{Refn|[https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ben10/images/d/d4/Night_of_the_Living_Nightmare_Script_First_Draft.pdf ''Night of the Living Nightmare'' Script First Draft]|group = script|name = first}}
*[[Derrick J. Wyatt]] did not think Ultimate Humungousaur was anywhere near as cool as Humungousaur, including their '''Omniverse''' designs. This is because he was more of a Brachiosaur fan, as nothing could top them in his eyes.{{Refn|[[:File:Derrick's Opinion on the Ultimates' Designs.png]]|group = DJW}}

